{'symbol': 'OXY', 'date': '2022-04-25 16:15:00', 'title': 'ENTERPRISE AND OXY LOW CARBON VENTURES SIGN LETTER OF INTENT FOR GULF COAST CO2 TRANSPORTATION AND SEQUESTRATION PROJECT', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ENTERPRISE PRODUCTS OPERATING LLC (“ENTERPRISE”), A SUBSIDIARY OF ENTERPRISE PRODUCTS PARTNERS L.P. (NYSE: EPD), AND OXY LOW CARBON VENTURES, LLC (“OLCV”), A SUBSIDIARY OF OCCIDENTAL (NYSE: OXY), TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE EXECUTED A LETTER OF INTENT TO WORK TOWARD A POTENTIAL CARBON DIOXIDE (“CO2”) TRANSPORTATION AND SEQUESTRATION SOLUTION FOR THE TEXAS GULF COAST. THE JOINT PROJECT WOULD INITIALLY BE FOCUSED ON PROVIDING SERVICES TO EMITTERS IN THE INDUSTRIAL CORRIDOR'}